B) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT.THE LAWSUIT ON BEHALF OF U.S. BANCORP INVESTORS HAS BEEN COMMENCED IN THE THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE SOUTHERN DISTRICT OF NEW YORK. AFFECTED INVESTORS PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED CERTAIN U.S. BANCORP SECURITIES BETWEEN AUGUST 1, 2019 AND JULY 28, 2022.'}{'symbol': 'USB', 'date': '2022-11-11 22:50:00', 'title': 'U.S. BANCORP SHAREHOLDER ALERT BY FORMER LOUISIANA ATTORNEY GENERAL: KAHN SWICK & FOTI, LLC REMINDS INVESTORS WITH LOSSES IN EXCESS OF $100,000 OF LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE IN CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST U.S. BANCORP - USB', 'text': 'NEW ORLEANS , NOV. 11, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- KAHN SWICK & FOTI, LLC ("KSF") AND KSF PARTNER, FORMER ATTORNEY GENERAL OF LOUISIANA, CHARLES C. FOTI, JR., REMIND INVESTORS THAT THEY HAVE UNTIL DECEMBER 27, 2022 TO FILE LEAD PLAINTIFF APPLICATIONS IN A SECURITIES CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST U.S. BANCORP (NYSE: USB), IF THEY PURCHASED THE COMPANY\'S SECURITIES BETWEEN AUGUST 1, 2019 AND JULY 28, 2022, INCLUSIVE (THE "CLASS PERIOD").'}{'symbol': 'USB', 'date': '2022-11-11 16:50:00', 'title': 'USB LAWSUIT ALERT: LEVI & KORSINSKY NOTIFIES U.S. BANCORP INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND UPCOMING DEADLINE', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - NOVEMBER 11, 2022) - LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN U.S. BANCORP ("U.S. BANCORP" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: USB) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT.THE LAWSUIT ON BEHALF OF U.S. BANCORP INVESTORS HAS BEEN COMMENCED IN THE THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE SOUTHERN DISTRICT OF NEW YORK. AFFECTED INVESTORS PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED CERTAIN U.S. BANCORP SECURITIES BETWEEN AUGUST 1, 2019 AND JULY 28, 2022.'}{'symbol': 'USB', 'date': '2022-11-11 09:17:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ACTION REMINDER: THE SCHALL LAW FIRM FILES CLASS ACTION ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS IN U.S. BANCORP AND ADVISES SHAREHOLDERS WITH LOSSES OF $100,000 TO CONTACT THE FIRM', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES, CALIFORNIA--(NEWSFILE CORP. - NOVEMBER 11, 202